            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "In this study, we used near-infrared SIF derived from data acquired by the Global Ozone Monitoring Experiment-2 (GOME-2) instrument on board EUMETSAT's polar orbiting Meteorological Operational Satellite-A (MetOp-A).",
