            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Data assimilation system description. The ORCHIDEE Data Assimilation (DA) System (http://orchidas.lsce.ipsl.fr) is based on a variational DA system that has been described in detail in previous studies 8,13,14. It follows a Bayesian framework, in which the optimal parameter vector x can be found by minimizing the following cost-function J(x), assuming that the probability distribution functions (PDFs) of the model parameter and observation uncertainties are Gaussian47:",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
